# Allowlist: ignore everything at the root, then allow only what Dockerfile.vercel needs.
# Second layer only: scripts/deploy_vercel.py deploys from a staging folder that already
# holds just these files, and refuses if anything else (or anything forbidden) is there.
/*
!Dockerfile.vercel
!.vercelignore
!requirements-api.lock
!LICENSE
!api
!src
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
